                            <comment id="15996826" author="ezhuravl" created="Thu, 4 May 2017 14:41:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt; GridContiniousProcessor.onStart invokes ctx.service().onContinuousProcessorStarted(ctx) too early, when caches not create yet(it happens in GridCacheProcessor.onKernalStart).&lt;br/&gt;
It&apos;s not possible to move ctx.service().onContinuousProcessorStarted(ctx) invoke to code after all caches start, because at the moment, when discoveryManager starts, this method must be already invoked.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
