                            <comment id="16519179" author="ezhuravl" created="Thu, 21 Jun 2018 10:00:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve checked team city: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F4226%2Fhead&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F4226%2Fhead&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&lt;/a&gt; - it contains some test failures, some of them are not reproducible, other were failed even before this fix.&lt;br/&gt;
